        "offset": 7472268,
        "header_offset": 7472264,
        "char_count": 11,
        "byte_length": 22,
        "control_gap_length": 2,
        "text": "ここで失礼いたします！",
        "translation": "여기서 실례하겠습니다!"
      },
      {
        "offset": 7472320,
        "header_offset": 7472316,
        "char_count": 8,
        "byte_length": 16,
        "control_gap_length": 26,
        "text": "次に襲撃されても",
        "translation": "다음에 습격당해도"
      },
      {
